Audio is not in this repository. Recitations stream from mp3quran.net
(whole surah) and everyayah.com (per ayah); both are third-party services with
their own terms, and nothing is cached or rehosted here.

The required attribution for the English translation is rendered in the app
itself - under every English surah, on the English selection screen, on each
static surah page, and appended when a reader copies a verse. **If you fork this
project, keep it.** Removing it breaks the licence the text is published under.
